  "statement": "Simplify \\[ \\frac{\\begin{gathered} bx(a^2x^2+2a^2y^2+b^2y^2)\\\\ {}+ay(a^2x^2+2b^2x^2+b^2y^2) \\end{gathered}}{bx+ay}. \\]",
